WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.565
"I'm so happy to see you all!" Roxy said.

2
00:00:03.566 --> 00:00:07.724
Her mom, Terrell, Bippo, and Dr. Odd were on her watch screen.

3
00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:10.857
"Where are you?" her mom asked.

4
00:00:10.858 --> 00:00:14.895
Roxy frowned. "I'm trapped somewhere in outer space.

5
00:00:14.896 --> 00:00:19.284
An alien is making me fight in a dumb battle contest."

6
00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.897
"Oh no!" her mom said.

7
00:00:21.898 --> 00:00:25.445
Cozlin waved. "Don't worry, Roxy's mom.

8
00:00:25.446 --> 00:00:27.992
We'll figure out how to escape."

9
00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:30.434
"Kid Comet!" Terrell said.

10
00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:33.463
"I'm here too!" Wukong said.

11
00:00:33.464 --> 00:00:38.044
"We have big problems on Earth, Rocket Girl," Dr. Odd said.

12
00:00:38.045 --> 00:00:40.308
"Earthquakes keep happening."

13
00:00:40.309 --> 00:00:43.727
"Shaking, us!" Bippo said.

14
00:00:43.728 --> 00:00:47.743
"I know," Roxy said. "A dragon told us."

15
00:00:47.744 --> 00:00:51.451
Her mom's eyes went wide. "A dragon?"

16
00:00:51.452 --> 00:00:54.443
"It's a long story," Roxy said.

17
00:00:54.444 --> 00:00:58.841
"But the dragon said the gold was placed underground by Buddha.

18
00:00:58.842 --> 00:01:04.021
Then somebody stole it." She glared at Cozlin, who grinned sheepishly.

19
00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:08.112
"How do we stop the earthquakes?" Dr. Odd asked.

20
00:01:08.113 --> 00:01:11.277
"We have to return the gold," Roxy said.

21
00:01:11.278 --> 00:01:14.709
Dr. Odd scratched his head. "How?"

22
00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:18.404
"Find the bodhisattva Guanyin," Wukong said.

23
00:01:18.405 --> 00:01:20.505
"She always helps me."

24
00:01:20.506 --> 00:01:23.963
"There's no need for that," Cozlin said.

25
00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:28.592
"Zark, the portal operator on Delkor, can help."

26
00:01:28.593 --> 00:01:33.004
She quickly shared his contact information.

27
00:01:33.005 --> 00:01:37.512
"Great!" Dr. Odd said. "We will—"

28
00:01:37.513 --> 00:01:41.865
Rumble! Rumble! The screen went blank.

29
00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:45.302
The mobile lab shook, knocking Dr. Odd out of his chair.

30
00:01:45.303 --> 00:01:47.819
When the shaking stopped, he got back up.

31
00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:51.276
Terrell frowned. "We lost the connection!"

32
00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:55.205
"At least we know Roxy is okay," her mom said.

33
00:01:55.206 --> 00:01:58.568
"And now I can locate her," Dr. Odd said.

34
00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:03.936
"But first I'll call Zark." He typed in several digits.

35
00:02:03.937 --> 00:02:07.718
A Delkorian appeared on a computer screen. "Hello."

36
00:02:07.719 --> 00:02:11.612
"Hey!" Terrell said. "We're friends with Kid Comet. She

37
00:02:11.613 --> 00:02:15.237
said you can help us return some gold to Earth." Zark

38
00:02:15.238 --> 00:02:17.064
rubbed the back of his neck. "I'm

39
00:02:17.065 --> 00:02:19.570
sorry, but I can't help you." "Why

40
00:02:19.571 --> 00:02:22.017
not?" Dr. Odd said. "This

41
00:02:22.018 --> 00:02:26.024
is important! Earthquakes are destroying our city. They

42
00:02:26.025 --> 00:02:29.639
won't stop unless we return that gold!" Zark

43
00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:33.528
sighed. "I'd like to help, but the gold is gone. It's

44
00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:37.505
just . . . vanished!" "Now

45
00:02:37.506 --> 00:02:42.193
what will we do?" Terrell asked after Dr. Odd hung up. Roxy's

46
00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:44.156
mom had an idea. "Wukong

47
00:02:44.157 --> 00:02:48.245
said to find the bodhisattva Guanyin." Terrell

48
00:02:48.246 --> 00:02:49.735
shook his head. "She's

49
00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:54.044
in a different universe. And we don't have a portal." Dr.

50
00:02:54.045 --> 00:02:57.061
Odd smiled. "Actually, we do. I

51
00:02:57.062 --> 00:03:01.056
traveled all over, searching for the Groonians. I

52
00:03:01.057 --> 00:03:03.077
still haven't found them. But

53
00:03:03.078 --> 00:03:09.171
I did visit Hulzar, where I learned everything about portal technology." Bippo

54
00:03:09.172 --> 00:03:14.715
pointed. "Smart, him!" ***

55
00:03:14.716 --> 00:03:20.730
"Attention!" The fighting stopped as the Battle Master's voice came over the loudspeaker.

56
00:03:20.731 --> 00:03:24.800
"The next round of battles will be two-on-two.

57
00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:28.032
You have one minute to select a partner."

58
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:31.360
Roxy, Cozlin, and Wukong looked at one another.

59
00:03:31.361 --> 00:03:33.619
Cozlin put her hands on her hips.

60
00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:38.023
"Well, Rocket Girl? Who are you going to choose?"

61
00:03:38.024 --> 00:03:42.990
"Me," Wukong said. "I'm the most powerful being here."

62
00:03:42.991 --> 00:03:47.181
"I can shoot lasers from my hands," Cozlin said.

63
00:03:47.182 --> 00:03:53.333
Wukong shrugged. "I have my iron bar. And I can turn into—" Voop!

64
00:03:53.334 --> 00:03:55.504
Cozlin walked through Wukong.

65
00:03:55.505 --> 00:03:59.301
"Hey!" Wukong said. "Don't do that!"

66
00:03:59.302 --> 00:04:03.733
"Please, stop arguing." Roxy sighed.

67
00:04:03.734 --> 00:04:09.722
"I wish I didn't have to choose. But I guess I'll go with Wukong."

68
00:04:09.723 --> 00:04:17.956
Cozlin gave her a hurt look and then hurried over to Sapphire.

